## Raw Telegram Bot API Only

- Use raw Bot API webhook at `src/app/api/webhooks/telegram/route.ts`
- Direct `fetch` to `https://api.telegram.org/bot{token}/...`
- Message templates in `src/lib/messages.ts`

## Forbidden

- ❌ Do NOT reintroduce Vercel Chat SDK
- ❌ Do NOT add `@chat-adapter/telegram`
- ❌ Do NOT import from `@vercel/ai`

## Customer Access

- Customers book via Telegram bot only (no web UI for customers)
- Barbers and admins use web panels
- Customers access barber via `/start` parameter with barber code
